    "detailed_description": "<strong><i>Your reflection online may be darker than it appears</i></strong><br><br>A psychological visual novel reimagining Oscar Wilde's classic for the social media age, crafted by gamers who are also published psychologists and neuroscientists.<br>Key Features:<br><br>Explore a Faustian pact with a social media twist across five acts of contemporary tragedy<br>Experience a narrative influenced by real psychological principles<br>Take the Barratt Impulsiveness Scale (BIS-11) and see how your choices align with your self-assessment<br>Play as Doran White, a fallen tech mogul who trades his soul for digital fame, grappling with past demons and present temptations<br>Original hand-drawn artwork and a custom soundtrack that enhances the modern visual novel experience<br><br>Your choices shape Doran's fate as his social media presence spirals out of control. Playing with psychophysiological factors of impulsivity, identity, and the digital age in a visual novel format.<br><br>Wishlist &quot;Darkly Glass&quot; now for a late 2024 release.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong><i>Your reflection online may be darker than it appears</i></strong><br><br>A psychological visual novel reimagining Oscar Wilde's classic for the social media age, crafted by gamers who are also published psychologists and neuroscientists.<br>Key Features:<br><br>Explore a Faustian pact with a social media twist across five acts of contemporary tragedy<br>Experience a narrative influenced by real psychological principles<br>Take the Barratt Impulsiveness Scale (BIS-11) and see how your choices align with your self-assessment<br>Play as Doran White, a fallen tech mogul who trades his soul for digital fame, grappling with past demons and present temptations<br>Original hand-drawn artwork and a custom soundtrack that enhances the modern visual novel experience<br><br>Your choices shape Doran's fate as his social media presence spirals out of control. Playing with psychophysiological factors of impulsivity, identity, and the digital age in a visual novel format.<br><br>Wishlist &quot;Darkly Glass&quot; now for a late 2024 release.",
    "short_description": "Trade your soul for digital fame in this psychological visual novel. As fallen tech mogul Doran White, navigate a treacherous social media landscape. Your choices shape his fate in this hand-drawn, neuroscience-inspired reimagining of Oscar Wilde's classic.",
